{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>לשבתך</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other: \"a house of Zevul have I built for You, a מכון לשבתך עולמים,\" and its companion in Chronicles. This is what the Sages said: the Temple below corresponds to the Temple above. \"מכון לשבתך\" — You made, YHWH; \"a house of Zevul have I built for You, a מכון לשבתך\" — corresponding to it. לשבתך in gematria: ירושלים ציון." "<b>ידיך</b> Extra yod on account of ten miracles that were performed in the Temple, and on account of ten sanctities through which the land was sanctified."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {0 "The third occurrence referenced is the phrase from Kings/Chronicles; the text says 'וחבירו בדה״י' (its companion in Chronicles), while the first cited phrase 'בנה בניתי בית זבול לך מכון לשבתך עולמים' is from 1 Kings 8:13 (= 2 Chronicles 6:2). The final juxtaposition 'מכון לשבתך פעלת ה׳' appears to cite an additional occurrence, possibly from Psalms."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:07.664613346Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}